                        ],
                        "form": "den Sandmann"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "40c0a005-47eb-4435-a79c-8b6d68cb4077",
                        "entry_id": "5b0a17e7-abdc-374f-a8c6-326a47bafb8a",
                        "tags": [
                            "accusative",
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "die Sandmänner"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f937df0d-35a6-339b-8ccd-ba905b822b4e",
                        "entry_id": "5b0a17e7-abdc-374f-a8c6-326a47bafb8a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Figur des westlichen Volksmythos, die kleine Kinder besucht und zum Einschlafen bringt, indem sie ihnen Sand in die Augen streut"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "63bfd9f0-c1db-43f6-97f1-51cc6aa84fd0",
                                "sense_id": "f937df0d-35a6-339b-8ccd-ba905b822b4e",
                                "text": "Der Sandmann ist auch eine Figur des westdeutschen Rundfunks, die dem „Sandmännchen“ im DDR-Rundfunk entspricht."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7bb050d5-a470-34b7-84b5-83af0f2d2f05",
                        "entry_id": "5b0a17e7-abdc-374f-a8c6-326a47bafb8a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "im Herzogtum Schleswig verwendete Bezeichnung für einen Titel von Gerichtsbeisitzern im Dänischen Königreich"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f88162b6-a154-4de9-8822-5cfc4b6bed0c",
                                "sense_id": "7bb050d5-a470-34b7-84b5-83af0f2d2f05",
                                "text": "„Vom königlichen Vogt wurden jeweils acht Sandmänner für jede Harde als Richter ernannt, deren Rechtsprechung bei Totschlag, Verstümmelung, Heerwerk, Notzucht und Streitigkeiten um Feldscheiden erforderlich wurde.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "420e1707-3e18-4e06-a231-f6acbb9b03a8",
                        "source_entry_id": "5b0a17e7-abdc-374f-a8c6-326a47bafb8a",
                        "source_sense_id": "f937df0d-35a6-339b-8ccd-ba905b822b4e",
                        "target_lang_word": "sandman",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sandman",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a5898d0c-ff35-3e86-aebf-935cf20b473a",
                                        "entry_id": "3294b01e-d4b5-3be8-8b79-3f335e82e260",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A figure that brings sleep and dreams by sprinkling magical sand into people's eyes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cab3d8f0-b8da-42d2-ac3b-5d5b493f6060",
                                                "sense_id": "a5898d0c-ff35-3e86-aebf-935cf20b473a",
                                                "text": "This then was the Sandman; but what was his occupation, and what was his purpose ? The nursery-maid being applied to, gave a nursery-maid's explanation, that the Sandman was a bad man, who flung sand in the eyes of little children who did not go to bed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9640ef8e-fe47-3493-b42f-84c63856a4ba",
                                        "entry_id": "3294b01e-d4b5-3be8-8b79-3f335e82e260",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used as a symbol of the passage of time toward death."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bbb1cb55-a058-3eea-9ae6-5bb1b13e5eb0",
                                        "entry_id": "3294b01e-d4b5-3be8-8b79-3f335e82e260",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A seller of sand."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d34e0cf-406e-4fd4-8122-177391be27e2",
                                                "sense_id": "bbb1cb55-a058-3eea-9ae6-5bb1b13e5eb0",
                                                "text": "1811, Arabian Nights' Entertainments, Consisting of One Thousand and One Stories, Told by the Sultaness of the Indies, Henry Mozley (publ.), page 114.\nWhile I was out, a sandman, who sells scouring sand, which women use to clean the baths with, passed through our street, and called, Any sand ho !"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bf84abc9-b069-4c84-b0d7-f58d2acee07e",
                        "source_entry_id": "5b0a17e7-abdc-374f-a8c6-326a47bafb8a",
                        "source_sense_id": "f937df0d-35a6-339b-8ccd-ba905b822b4e",
                        "target_lang_word": "marchand de sable",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "marchand de sable",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e24af135-316e-3efe-92a3-96a8c69474c2",
                                        "entry_id": "51976778-3775-37eb-a07d-118febeba3d8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personnage mythique versant du sable sur les yeux des enfants pour les endormir."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b746e11-a9b6-4279-b130-59bec760abba",
                                                "sense_id": "e24af135-316e-3efe-92a3-96a8c69474c2",
                                                "text": "Le marchand de sable venait de m’en lancer une bonne poignée."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "610f57b4-a480-4ac6-ba8d-6abe87c17caa",
                                                "sense_id": "e24af135-316e-3efe-92a3-96a8c69474c2",
                                                "text": "« Merci Niquedouille.\n— Fermez vos mignons petits yeux ensommeillés. Le marchand de sable va passer. »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96182132-aa92-46c1-b7e5-80286858f036",
                                                "sense_id": "e24af135-316e-3efe-92a3-96a8c69474c2",
                                                "text": "Nous apportons joie et rêve… Nous sommes le marchand de sable et la Fée des dents. Nous sommes le lapin de Pâques et le père Noël."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "90b5a1a6-4077-4f4e-bb68-2ebea9638430",
                        "source_entry_id": "5b0a17e7-abdc-374f-a8c6-326a47bafb8a",
                        "source_sense_id": "f937df0d-35a6-339b-8ccd-ba905b822b4e",
